# The lease file cleanup that kea-dhcp4/kea-dhcp6 start (Px: its own
# AppArmor profile on Debian/Ubuntu, which only knows Kea's own lease file
# names). install.py adds these rules to the profile's local include
# (/etc/apparmor.d/local/usr.sbin.kea-lfc). The path is the default of
# kea_data_dir in /etc/portitor/agent.yaml.
/var/lib/kea/kea-leases[46]-*.csv* rw,
